dx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T10:15:00Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T10:15:00Z","body":"Indeed, reverting pr https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101797 fixes the issue.\n\nCC @TokageItLab","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650358301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650628765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102679#issuecomment-2650628765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102679","id":2650628765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d_WKd","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T12:12:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T12:12:40Z","body":"This case depends on the error tolerance. A possible solution is to reduce the epsilon value as in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102144.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650628765/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749750141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102679#issuecomment-2749750141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102679","id":2749750141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j5dt9","user":{"login":"ohadfarkash","id":38788875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4Nzg4ODc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38788875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash","html_url":"https://github.com/ohadfarkash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohadfarkash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T00:48:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T00:48:33Z","body":"I was advised to comment here to help elevate the current status of this issue.\n\nIn my case I was trying to rotate vectors in the same angle and direction as another vector. I was also doing this in small increments, and I suspect this may have cause the deviations I was encountering.\n\nAs a result the following function began to return incorrect results in 4.4:\n```gdscript\nfunc copy_rotation(original_a: Vector3, original_b: Vector3, rotated_a: Vector3) -> Vector3:\n\t# Normalize the vectors to ensure calculations are correct\n\toriginal_a = original_a.normalized()\n\trotated_a = rotated_a.normalized()\n\n\t# Compute the rotation quaternion that rotates original_a to rotated_a\n\tvar rotation_quat = Quaternion(original_a, rotated_a)\n\n\t# Apply the same rotation to original_b\n\tvar rotated_b = rotation_quat.normalized() * original_b\n\n\treturn rotated_b\n```\n\nTo work around this issue I changed the function like so:\n```gdscript\nfunc copy_rotation(original_a: Vector3, original_b: Vector3, rotated_a: Vector3) -> Vector3:\n\t# Check if it's within threshold to prevent errors\n\tif original_a.distance_to(rotated_a) < 0.00001: return original_b.normalized()\n\t# Get the rotation axis\n\tvar rotation_axis = original_a.cross(rotated_a).normalized()\n\n\t# Get the rotation angle\n\tvar angle = original_a.angle_to(rotated_a)\n\n\t# Create a rotation basis\n\tvar rotation_basis: Basis = Basis(rotation_axis, angle)\n\n\t# Rotate original_b using the rotation basis\n\tvar rotated_b = rotation_basis * original_b\n\treturn rotated_b\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749750141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]